{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a series of cataclysmic events, people begin to disappear and you are not an exception. Your morning starts as usual, you wake up and get ready for the day, but all of a sudden a deafening noise comes from outside. You go to investigate, only to come face to face with a peculiar object. As you touch it, a voice echoes from the sky. Out of nowhere a crystal looking creature emerges. You try to run, but your body won't listen, an unimaginable sense of fear makes its presence felt as you are hurled by a wind so strong that it peels off small pieces of your skin. You find yourself lost in an unknown plane of existence where the perception of reality is distorted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you be able to escape?</strong><br><br><strong>Between These Two Demo</strong> includes part of a playable level from the full game. While traveling into the unknown, you find yourself in an abandoned amusement park.\u00a0The exit has a seal protecting it, to break it you will have to solve carnival-themed puzzles, but be careful, there is also danger waiting for you.    <br>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060120/extras/c37c0112c41a7527d26daed5ab7b6d1b.poster.avif?t=1760979679\" width=512 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060120/extras/c37c0112c41a7527d26daed5ab7b6d1b.webm?t=1760979679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060120/extras/c37c0112c41a7527d26daed5ab7b6d1b.mp4?t=1760979679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Demo Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>-Linear gameplay:</strong> Atmospheric, story-driven experience.<br><strong>-Puzzles and Riddles:</strong>\u00a0Solve puzzles that will guide you to the way out.<br><strong>-Indirect Combat:</strong> Enemies cannot be defeated by brute force, a keen eye will find the way of defeating enemies.<br><strong>-Exploration:</strong> Enter the unknown and discover its hidden secrets.<br><br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ultimate explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4060120/346099c47d1f3102ed2e9d3b5ec508aa390e6f4b.jpg"},{"name":"Something is wrong with this radio","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4060120/36720949479daee1f0208eaf8a599f2d8f326f98.jpg"},{"name":"Clowns are cute, aren't they?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4060120/4f7d20caf5370f8ccddd33a1a0c44e2c8845794b.jpg"},{"name":"Doll breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4060120/910bc9819b3a255eb7705227d9c0a2054cec2b25.jpg"},{"name":"Coin collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4060120/788905d12a75505fbbcf5ae16cc775f11a807168.jpg"},{"name":"Clear path","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4060120/33ea4b42dc3cae83f4ec5b972d08fd5a0cc42614.jpg"},{"name":"Pop a balloon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4060120/0d516c60921ec68297d84c7337db921a8ae6a5a5.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060120?t=1760979679","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060120?t=1760979679","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/